			"notes": "Create: Heart Factory for **Minecraft 1.21.1 + NeoForge + Create 6.0.x**.\n\nThis is the **primary / latest** release for the mod.\n\n## Installation\n1. Install **NeoForge** for Minecraft 1.21.1\n2. Install **Create** 6.0.x\n3. Drop `heartfactory-2.0.1.jar` into your `mods` folder\n\n## Features\n- Extract absorption hearts from players using a Create Deployer\n- Process hearts on assembly lines (painting, pressing, molten netherite)\n- Permanent health upgrades and endgame Netherite Hearts\n\n## Other versions\n- **Forge 1.20.1:** see releases `v2.0.0-forge` and `v2.0.1-forge`"
		},
